Exit 2 when a device needs a change (and none could not be planned).
.TP
\fB\-\-restore\-point\fR[=\fI<fs>\fR]
(IOS and IOS\-XE only) A restore point block before the plan: a copy of the running configuration on <fs> (flash:, bootflash:, disk0:), or, bare, 'archive config' where the pull read an archive path; the back\-out names 'configure replace' with it; a file, not a timer (the bare form has not been checked on a device).
.RE
