the state
.RB ( ok ,
.BR differs ,
.BR never ,
.BR failed ,
and
.B pull
for a Cisco device whose configuration syntax is unknown: its setting is auto
and its record has no version line, or one that maps to no syntax: it is
compared in neither syntax, and a pull whose version line is not read or not
mapped is refused and not recorded, so the state stays until a pull reads a
