.RS
.PP
Requires: \fBsuperuser\fR.
.RE
.\" END GENERATED: command breakglass release
.TP
.BR "breakglass list " [ \-\-json ]
The holds that stand: name, kind (device or host), address, scope that answers
the address, since, how long, by whom and why (a record whose address no scope
covers says so; a record that holds no registered device or enrolled host is
marked
.BR orphan ,
and
.B \-\-json
has
.BR orphan:true ,
and
.BR kind ).
An engineer sees the devices and hosts of their own scopes only.
.\" BEGIN GENERATED: command breakglass list
